# Solver outputs: regenerate with scripts/, never commit.
results/
*.npz
*.png
!validation/gallery/**/*.png
!docs/figures/*.png
*.pdf

# Grids are third-party input data (NASA TMR C-grids, 124 MB), kept locally for
# the RANS phase and freely re-obtainable; see data/grids/README.md. The solver's
# own O-grids are generated in closed form and never stored.
data/grids/*
!data/grids/README.md

# Download archives: the extracted grids live in data/grids/.
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Commit stamp of a copy synced without .git (io/output.py reads it).
GIT_COMMIT

# Local working notes and site-specific run scripts: not part of the project.
Execution Plan.md
HPC_execution.md
scripts/hpc/
.claude/
